# Every key is optional. On a machine with an NVIDIA GPU (or Apple Silicon) and Claude Code logged in, Flicello
# paints, makes music and sound, animates, hears and speaks without any of them. Keys are for doing those things
# with an online service instead. The easiest place to add them is the Connect page (http://127.0.0.1:8765/connect),
# which keeps them in your computer's keychain; this file works too. .env is git-ignored; never paste keys in chat.

# Gemini: a faster online voice for Cello, and watching footage and painting when this machine has no GPU for them.
# https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ElevenLabs: music and sound effects when this machine can't make them. https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Higgsfield: shots made from your words when this machine can't make them, paid from your Higgsfield balance.
# Paste the whole key as its console shows it: id:secret.  https://higgsfield.ai
# HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY=

# Anthropic API: only if you'd rather pay per use than use your Claude Code plan. https://console.anthropic.com
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Music search (free): https://devportal.jamendo.com -> sign up -> create an app -> Client ID.
# Without it, music is searched on Openverse (no key needed, smaller selection).
# JAMENDO_CLIENT_ID=
